+// Number of parallel dds blocks. NOTE: fir_compiler_0 must be regenerated to
+// match -- its Output_Sample_Period is the decimation rate divided by N_DDS.
+// The copy shipped here is built for N_DDS=1 (SamplePeriod 8).
